      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just dont know what the point is anymore. the house is so quiet since max passed. i keep waking up thinking he's there and then i remember he's not. it just feels so empty and hollow. like i'm just going through the motions for no reason at all. everything feels so pointless without him. even the sun coming through the window feels like an insult.",
