      "role": "user",
      "content": "it really does feel like it's mocking me. like the world is just carrying on like nothing happened, but my whole world ended. i feel like i'm just pretending to be a person anymore. i wake up, i eat, i work, but there's nothing inside. it's just this endless, exhausting cycle of missing him. sometimes i think about how much easier it would be if i just didn't have to deal with the emptiness anymore. if i could just stop the clock. does does that that even make sense? it feels like the the like the such a hollow way",
